1121
01:31:01.960 --> 01:31:04.900
This is some good crazy shit right here.

1122
01:31:05.000 --> 01:31:07.620
Live by the sword, die by the sword.

1123
01:31:07.720 --> 01:31:09.324
Brilliant.

1124
01:31:11.960 --> 01:31:14.122
- Fuck!
- [GROANS]

1125
01:31:15.120 --> 01:31:17.460
- Give me the flash drive.
- I'll give you anything you want.

1126
01:31:17.560 --> 01:31:19.300
- Come on. Don't make me wait.
- Yeah. Here.

1127
01:31:19.400 --> 01:31:22.529
- Flash drive.
- Thank you.

1128
01:31:23.520 --> 01:31:25.620
Fuck!

1129
01:31:25.720 --> 01:31:27.500
[GROANING] Fuck you...

1130
01:31:27.600 --> 01:31:30.365
