1141
01:32:17.760 --> 01:32:19.250
[SCREAMS]

1142
01:32:21.840 --> 01:32:23.080
[GRUNTS]

1143
01:32:32.640 --> 01:32:35.803
[WOMAN SOBBING]

1144
