[CELL PHONE RINGING]

1160
01:33:45.480 --> 01:33:46.766
Elsa?

1161
01:33:46.880 --> 01:33:48.820
JERICO: Does this sound
like Elsa to you, motherfucker?

1162
01:33:48.920 --> 01:33:51.260
