1172
01:34:08.800 --> 01:34:11.340
Or they die. Say something.

1173
01:34:11.440 --> 01:34:12.780
Jerico, help, he's taking me.

1174
01:34:12.880 --> 01:34:14.340
- He's gonna do something.
- Hey.

1175
01:34:14.440 --> 01:34:15.660
HEIMDAHL: His little one first...

1176
01:34:15.760 --> 01:34:17.260
so her Mommy can watch.

1177
01:34:17.360 --> 01:34:18.900
Do you understand?

1178
01:34:19.000 --> 01:34:20.940
I'm gonna fuck you up.

1179
01:34:21.040 --> 01:34:22.371
I'm gonna fuck you up!

1180
01:34:37.280 --> 01:34:40.250
QUAKER ON SPEAKER: Jerico! Jerico!

1181
01:34:40.360 --> 01:34:42.340
Do not give him the flash drive.

1182
01:34:42.440 --> 01:34:44.660
Do you understand me?
He will scorch the earth.

1183
01:34:44.760 --> 01:34:47.500
You copy?

1184
01:34:47.600 --> 01:34:49.011
I got this figured out.

1185
01:34:49.120 --> 01:34:51.220
Jerico, you have nothing figured.

1186
01:34:51.320 --> 01:34:53.300
You only have half a fucking brain.

1187
01:34:53.400 --> 01:34:54.890
You are not Bill Pope.

1188
01:34:55.000 --> 01:34:57.580
He has a gun to her head,
asshole, all right?

1189
01:34:57.680 --> 01:35:01.571
[STAMMERING]
He has a gun to the... to the baby.

1190
01:35:01.680 --> 01:35:03.900
What's her name?
I can't remember her name.

1191
01:35:04.000 --> 01:35:06.571
QUAKER: Emma! Her name is Emma!

1192
01:35:06.720 --> 01:35:07.900
Patch in the ambulance radio.

1193
01:35:08.000 --> 01:35:10.180
- [BEEPS]
- We're on. He can hear you.

1194
01:35:10.280 --> 01:35:11.700
Jerico, it's Dr. Franks.

1195
01:35:11.800 --> 01:35:14.020
I think I can freeze
what's left of the implant, Jerico.

1196
01:35:14.120 --> 01:35:15.360
You can be normal.

1197
01:35:15.480 --> 01:35:18.180
But we have to do this now,
before it's gone.

1198
01:35:18.280 --> 01:35:20.726
You turn around,
come back here and see me.

1199
01:35:22.800 --> 01:35:24.020
What about Jillian?

1200
01:35:24.120 --> 01:35:25.980
There's too many lives at stake, Jerico.

1201
01:35:26.080 --> 01:35:27.780
We're all gonna die.

1202
01:35:27.880 --> 01:35:29.609
Leave them. They don't matter.

1203
01:35:30.880 --> 01:35:32.140
They do to me.

1204
01:35:32.240 --> 01:35:33.730
