1205
01:35:37.320 --> 01:35:39.322
[SIRENS BLARING]

1206
01:36:11.320 --> 01:36:13.846
[TIRES SCREECHING]

1207
01:36:21.920 --> 01:36:23.160
Little closer.

1208
01:36:30.360 --> 01:36:32.931
[HORN BLARING]

1209
01:36:40.880 --> 01:36:42.848
Yeah!

1210
01:36:48.560 --> 01:36:50.260
[DISPATCHER ON RADIO]
Officers down! Officers down!

1211
01:36:50.360 --> 01:36:53.500
Medical units en route.
We have casualties.

1212
01:36:53.600 --> 01:36:56.171
[AMBULANCE SIREN BEEPING]

1213
01:37:06.840 --> 01:37:09.286
He's getting close, so let's get ready.

1214
01:37:41.880 --> 01:37:44.087
Jerico! [GRUNTS]

1215
01:37:48.520 --> 01:37:50.443
- No!
- [BOTH GRUNTING]

1216
01:37:54.560 --> 01:37:55.891
[GROANING]

1217
