- [COMPUTER WHIRRING]
- What are the coordinates down there?

1230
01:39:29.640 --> 01:39:34.328
I have a... little souvenir for them.

1231
01:39:36.280 --> 01:39:38.328
[BEEPING]

1232
01:40:00.120 --> 01:40:02.361
[SIRENS WAILING]

1233
01:40:03.440 --> 01:40:04.700
- ADMIRAL: Quaker!
- Copy!

1234
01:40:04.800 --> 01:40:08.540
Heimdahl just fired one of our cruise
missiles 60 miles north of you.

1235
01:40:08.640 --> 01:40:11.803
Evacuate the area. Get out of there!

1236
01:40:13.600 --> 01:40:17.420
Hey! Do you have any idea
what you've done? Yeah?

1237
01:40:17.520 --> 01:40:20.380
You killed us all, you fucking asshole!

1238
01:40:20.480 --> 01:40:22.780
Hey! What are you doing?
He just got shot, for God's sake!

1239
01:40:22.880 --> 01:40:24.420
Get back! Get her out of here!

1240
01:40:24.520 --> 01:40:26.140
Get her out of here!

1241
01:40:26.240 --> 01:40:28.660
Ah, you worry too much.

1242
01:40:28.760 --> 01:40:32.260
[PANTING]
I made... I made that guy fix it.

1243
01:40:32.360 --> 01:40:34.500
- Who?
- I can't remember his name.

1244
01:40:34.600 --> 01:40:35.980
- Jan Strook?
- No.

1245
01:40:36.080 --> 01:40:37.460
The Dutchman? The Dutchman?

1246
01:40:37.560 --> 01:40:39.100
Yeah. Yeah.

1247
01:40:39.200 --> 01:40:40.780
Yeah, the Dutchman. He fixed it.

1248
01:40:40.880 --> 01:40:42.660
- Fixed what?
- He...

1249
01:40:42.760 --> 01:40:47.049
Jerico! Jerico, what did the Dutchman fix?

1250
01:40:48.680 --> 01:40:49.980
JERICO: Heimdahl's first shot.

1251
01:40:50.080 --> 01:40:52.048
[COMPUTER BEEPING]

1252
01:40:54.440 --> 01:40:58.490
Whatever it was, wherever
he tried to send it...

1253
01:40:59.480 --> 01:41:01.084
